WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Step 1: Use the main navigation at the top to open a feature. On phones, Home, Rostering, Comms, Checklists and More remain in the bottom bar.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.250
Step 2: Use the permanent bar on the left to switch between that feature’s subpages. Larger screens show labels; phones keep a compact icon bar. The selected subpage stays highlighted.

3
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:26.083
Step 3: Open the blue account dropdown for User profile, Dark mode, Help &amp; support and your available Settings.

4
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:33.542
Step 4: Use browser Back and Forward to return to earlier screens. Save or resolve outstanding changes before leaving an editor.
